# Deliberately empty of rules.
#
# This domain keeps no state on the machine, so nothing is labelled
# kantainer_socket_client_file_t and there is no path to declare here. Contrast
# kantainer_portainer.fc, which labels /var/lib/portainer.
#
# The file exists rather than being absent because refpolicy's build Makefile is
# not consistent across releases about whether a module may have no .fc at all,
# and a build that breaks on a Fedora bump is a worse trade than four lines of
# comment. build_files/build.sh copies selinux/*.fc as a set.
